# 🗺️ Implementation Plan — PesisirConnect

> **Dokumen ini berisi analisis menyeluruh terhadap kondisi project saat ini, progress pengerjaan terbaru, dan rencana pengembangan fitur lanjutan untuk membawa Pesisir-Connect ke level berikutnya.**

---

## 📈 STATUS PRODUCTION READINESS (Updated: June 16, 2026)

### Overall: 90% READY ⚠️ (Meningkat dari 85%)

**READY FOR PRODUCTION:**
- ✅ Core marketplace features (listing, checkout, payment, reviews)
- ✅ Admin dashboard & management
- ✅ Vendor portal (products, orders, earnings, payouts)
- ✅ Email system (code complete, ready to test with real SMTP)
- ✅ **Invoice PDF generation** (Terpasang: `barryvdh/laravel-dompdf` ✅)
- ✅ Authorization & policies (ProductPolicy, TransactionPolicy, VendorReviewPolicy)
- ✅ Customer dashboard & wishlists
- ✅ Refactored Checkout & Payment Flow (Vanilla JS Snap integration, simplified dates ✅)

**BLOCKERS BEFORE LAUNCH (2-3 jam kerja):**
- 🔴 **Database**: SQLite → MySQL migration
- 🔴 **Email Config**: Configure SMTP (Mailtrap/SendGrid/Gmail API)
- 🟡 **Queue Worker**: Setup Supervisor/PM2 untuk async email queue (recommended)

**Action Required:** Selesaikan Sprint 2.5 items sebelum go-live.

