## 📊 Ringkasan Analisis Project

### Stack Teknologi Saat Ini
| Layer | Teknologi | Status |
|---|---|---|
| **Framework** | Laravel 11/12 (PHP 8.3+) | Aktif |
| **Frontend** | Blade + Tailwind CSS 3 + Alpine.js / Vanilla JS | Aktif |
| **Build Tool** | Vite | Aktif |
| **Admin Panel** | Custom Laravel UI & Filament v3/v5 | Aktif |
| **Payment** | Midtrans PHP SDK v2.6 | Terintegrasi & Stabil (Snap popup, webhook, callback) |
| **PDF Engine** | `barryvdh/laravel-dompdf` v3.1 | **Selesai Diinstal & Terintegrasi** ✅ |
| **Database** | SQLite (development) | Perlu migrasi ke MySQL sebelum live |
| **Auth** | Laravel Breeze | Aktif |

